                                                "sense_id": "c6e7f3bb-09c0-3fd8-9c4d-09b76873b2a5",
                                                "text": "Bishops demissionary served as rectors of several churches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b39458fd-cab4-4221-8692-8046fc2dcb7c",
                                                "sense_id": "c6e7f3bb-09c0-3fd8-9c4d-09b76873b2a5",
                                                "text": "The cabinet had only demissionary status and powers as a caretaker government."
